  "description": "The Elf Bar AF5500 Prefilled Pod Vape Kit offers a smarter, longer-lasting way to enjoy your favourite Elf Bar flavours. Designed for MTL (mouth-to-lung) vaping, this compact kit combines a 2ml prefilled pod with a 10ml refill reservoir that automatically tops up your pod as you vape. With its rechargeable 1000mAh battery, USB-C charging, and smooth draw-activated inhale, it delivers consistent flavour and up to 5500 puffs per pod setup. Each AF5500 kit includes one of ten Elf Bar flavour favourites, prefilled with 20mg nic salt e-liquid for a clean, satisfying vape. The integrated 1.2ohm mesh coil provides excellent flavour clarity and vapour production, while the mess-free refill design makes this a low-maintenance alternative to traditional disposables. Choose from ten outstanding Elf Bar flavours available in 2ml pod+10ml refill packs. Elf Bar AF5500 Prefilled Kit Flavours • Blue Razz Lemonade • Blueberry Ice • Blueberry Sour Raspberry • Lemon Lime • Sour Pineapple Ice • Strawberry Ice • Watermelon Ice • Cherry Ice • Grape • Strawberry Raspberry Cherry Ice With no buttons, no coils to change, and no messy refilling, the Elf Bar AF5500 makes vaping simpler and more flavourful than ever. When both the pod and refill run out, just replace the entire cartridge and you're ready to go again. Please Note: This kit does NOT come with a USB-C cable Shop Elf Bar AF5500 Refill Pods",
